    },
    {
      "id": "claim_041f3f643bcf4d47a8d5fb121fa744e7",
      "statement": "A resident Durable Object moves to a new deployment at a safe point (no request, alarm handler, durability wait, or regular WebSocket), is forced after CELLD_DEPLOY_MAX_AGE_S seconds (default 60, 0 forces at once), and in the adoption window a request on one deployment can call a Durable Object on the other.",
